WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:01.620
In Madrid,

2
00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:05.590
the search result for your About
page shows the English title and URL.

3
00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:08.550
Your app shows Spanish with gt-next,

4
00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:11.750
but that version has no
URL or title of its own.

5
00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:17.380
General Translation lets you give every
language its own URL and tell search

6
00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:18.450
engines about them.

7
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:26.270
Move your pages into app/[locale], and the
middleware serves Spanish at /es/about.

8
00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:31.290
The root layout sets the html
lang attribute with useLocale.

9
00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:37.810
A helper adds canonical and hreflang
links, and getGT translates the title.

10
00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:41.930
A sitemap lists every
page in every language.

11
00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:46.430
In Madrid, the result can now
show the Spanish title and URL.
